//! K14.C31 graphics + compute execution qualification.
//!
//! C31 makes command encoding, separate compute/graphics queues, owned shader
//! upload, pipeline state, compute dispatch, graphics draw, display sync and the
//! shader cache/precache path executable in QEMU. The executor is explicitly the
//! Titanweave reference backend over real C28 GTT/C30 scanout memory. Physical
//! Radeon CP/GFX/MEC queue programming and native AMD ISA execution remain false
//! until their exact firmware/page-table/privileged-register prerequisites are
//! live; C31 never re-labels reference execution as silicon execution.

